ith a small cowlick, oatmeal-beige knit cardigan over a white shirt. PLACE: the wooden-floored porch (maru) of a small countryside hanok with a grey-tiled roof, a big old pine tree in the yard, and a small white-painted wooden birdhouse with a heart-shaped entrance hole hanging under the eave. Close-up of the man on the porch, golden autumn light. He looks down at Kachi, who stands on his knee in the foreground; his eyes fill with tears and a slow, amazed smile spreads across his face as he recognizes the faded red knotted neckerchief. Above them under the eave, the weathered white birdhouse with the heart-shaped hole. The magpie is exactly the character in the magpie reference image: a small round chibi magpie with a glossy black head, cream-white face and belly, big shiny dark-brown eyes, short black beak, dark navy-blue wings, a red knotted neckerchief and a small brown leather satchel. It does NOT hold a microphone. Style: handcrafted 3D miniature diorama photographed with a macro lens, tilt-shift, shallow depth of field, soft cinematic light, felt, clay, paper and wood textures with tiny hand-painted details, gentle film grain, warm nostalgic color grade, clay figurines with soft rounded faces and deeply emotional Pixar-like expressions, not photorealistic. Vertical 9:16 frame, main subject in the middle of the frame, a calm uncluttered area in the top fifth of the frame. Absolutely no text, no letters, no numbers, no hangul, no logos, no labels, no brand names, no watermark anywhere.", "refs": ["social/side/gen/c1_magpie.jpeg", "social/side/gen/kh1_chick.jpeg", "social/side/gen/kh2_now.jpeg"], "reuse": null, "action": "The man slowly smiles through tears; Kachi tilts its head and puffs its chest proudly.", "dur": 5, "cap": "It still wore his handkerchief.", "detail": "알아보는 순간 — 빨간 목수건이 그 손수건"}]$q$::jsonb) where id='P261031-kachi-handkerchief'